children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Sign in to sync"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/09"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Legal pitfalls that ordinary people often overlook"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Do not share unverified messages about disasters, epidemics, or police incidents in groups; do not photoshop images or use AI to generate fake scene pictures"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Do not post, share, or comment images, memes, or remarks that insult heroes and martyrs, nor make jokes about the national flag or anthem"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"After viewing content on foreign websites, simply close the page — do not screenshot, share, repost, or discuss it in any groups or comment sections"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Watching porn alone is fine, but don’t post it in groups, sell “resources,” or create groups"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Part-time jobs that ask you to use your own card to receive payments, withdraw cash, or transfer money — no matter how much extra pay they offer, avoid them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/09-06","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Some people try to get you to “package loan applicants” for them and offer a commission based on the loan amount — don’t fall for it"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Keeping found items and not using them for personal gain; returning lost phones, wallets, or cash to owners or police"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Use your real identity to claim discounts — don’t register fake accounts or exploit loopholes to get more"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Never throw anything from balconies or windows — cigarette butts, trash bags, and bottles all count"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Do not buy imitation guns, BB guns, or air rifles online; avoid “toy guns” of unknown origin"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Register drones with your real name first; never fly near airports, military zones, or restricted urban airspace, and don’t tamper with altitude limits"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Do not secretly film others, nor install cameras in rented apartments, homestays, or hotel rooms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Mahjong and poker can be played — no rake, no banker role, no organizing paid games, no online gambling"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Do not eat wild animals; do not buy, sell, or keep protected species as pets"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"You cannot detain or confine someone to collect a debt, nor follow them home and refuse to leave"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Do not lend your ID card, do not use someone else’s ID card, and do not register, open accounts, or buy tickets using another person’s documents"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Cooperate when stopped or taken away by police — don’t push, hit, or grab their body cameras; especially if you’ve been drinking, stay calm"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Sexual relations with anyone under 14 are illegal; “she consented” is not a defense"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Do the math before you hit someone: detention, fines, and prison time"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"If parents cannot care for their newborn, the only legal option is to register the adoption with the civil affairs bureau: paying someone to hand over the child may be prosecuted as child trafficking, while abandoning the child constitutes abandonment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Don’t fabricate accidents or exaggerate damages to defraud insurance payouts: this is insurance fraud, and anyone helping you testify, assess damage, or repair your vehicle is equally liable"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Don’t sell your own organs, and don’t help others find donors: a kidney brings in just over $20,000, but the same kidney can be sold to a patient for $200,000. All proceeds are seized, plus a fine of 10–20 times the transaction amount"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Don’t engage in prostitution: the default penalty is 10–15 days in detention, not just a fine"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Distributing unauthorized Chinese-dubbed comics, pirated movies/TV shows, cloud storage links, and pirated e-books — even for free — is illegal; adding ads or charging membership fees can lead to criminal charges"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"To publish or monetize fan works, first obtain permission from the original copyright holder, or replace the borrowed characters’ names and relationships with your own"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/09-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"Do not buy and carry batons, stun devices, daggers, or pepper spray for self-defense; keeping them in your car also counts as carrying"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/09"},"children":["Chapter 9"," ·"," ","Legal pitfalls that ordinary people often overlook"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"09-06"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["06"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Some people try to get you to “package loan applicants” for them and offer a commission based on the loan amount — don’t fall for it"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Helping others “package” loan applications in order to get a cut of the proceeds is a form of fraud. One criminal gang of 126 members turned unemployed individuals into “prime customers” and tricked over 80 banks into issuing loans totaling more than 30 million yuan. Those who signed the loan documents on behalf of the applicants received 30% of each loan amount as a commission. Out of the 80 people convicted so far, 76 have been sentenced to between 1 year and 4 months and 6 years and 6 months in prison. Remember: the person whose name appears on the loan contract is legally responsible for repaying it."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no cost at all. Just say no. Never lend your ID ca…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Committing fraud to obtain loans, acceptance letters, letters of credit, or guarantees from banks or other fin…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Some people try to get you to “package loan applicants” for them and offer a commission based on the loan amount — don’t fall for it"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no cost at all. Just say no. Never lend your ID card or credit report to anyone, sign any loan contracts you haven’t read, or go to the bank to sign on someone else’s behalf."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Committing fraud to obtain loans, acceptance letters, letters of credit, or guarantees from banks or other financial institutions is a serious crime. If such actions cause substantial financial harm, offenders face up to 3 years in prison plus a fine; if the damage is especially severe, sentences range from 3 to 7 years, also with fines. The threshold for police investigation is a direct financial loss exceeding 500,000 yuan. Those who fabricate investment projects, fake contracts, or forged documents to secure loans commit loan fraud — this crime is punishable by up to 5 years in prison and fines ranging from 20,000 to 200,000 yuan if the amount obtained is 50,000 yuan or more. Larger sums or more serious circumstances lead to sentences from 5 to 10 years, or even life imprisonment. Forging, altering, or selling official government documents or seals carries penalties of up to 3 years; more serious cases result in 3–10 years in prison. A notable case involved 126 criminals who created fake “prime customers” in 16 provinces and tricked over 80 banks out of more than 30 million yuan; 105 “front” applicants were prosecuted. In 2026, 76 of them received sentences of 1 year and 4 months to 6 years and 6 months for loan fraud, while four others were additionally convicted of money laundering and received sentences from 2 years and 4 months to 7 years and 6 months. Under the 2021 amendment to the Criminal Law, anyone who signs a loan contract becomes legally liable for repayment — even if they never intended to pay, the debt and negative credit record remain theirs. Attempts to flee abroad won’t help; fugitives can still be extradited years later. Those serving sentences, under investigation, or involved in civil disputes may be barred from leaving the country. For details on how to spot unauthorized loans taken out in your name, see Section 8, Item 9."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2020). 刑法修正案（十一）（第十一条，修改刑法第一百七十五条之一）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202012/t20201227_503700.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202012/